#. y1:english="Ah, hello. {PA:20}If you want to know about||the nightlife of this town,\nyou came to the right guy.\nI'll tell you about some interesting places.{PA:20}\nTell me about \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la{CR:00}\".\nShangri-la's an Asian massage parlour for||VIP members only. It's on E. Taihei Blvd.\nGetting a hold of a membership||card is {PA:10}very difficult.\nRumour has it that they're being sold||for ridiculously high prices\non the black market.\nBy the way,||Shinji-san's favorite girl's name is Akemi.\nShe is the number one \"masseuse\" there.\nTell me about \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shine{CR:00}\".\nShine's a hostess bar||in the central section of Pink St.\nThey got pretty good girls||for a reasonable price.\nHowever,{PA:10} I heard||there are many scandalous bars in that area.\nI recommend \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shine{CR:00}\".\nTell me about \"{CC:ffc8c8}Jewel{CR:00}\".\nGo out this information centre,||and walk east on Shichifuku St.\nYou'll find a hostess bar called||\"{CC:ffc8c8}Jewel{CR:00}\" on your left.\nThis is another good spot.{PA:20}||I recommend it."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0070.BIN:73_12_18
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0070.BIN::line:73_12_18"
msgid "Encontrarás un bar de alterne que||se llama \"{CC:ffc8c8}Jewel{CR:00}\" a tu izquierda."
msgstr ""

