#. y1:english="If you wanna know about the nightlife||of this town, you came to the right guy.{PA:20}\nI'll tell you about some interesting places.{PA:20}\nYou must be {PA:10}Masutatsu Mizuno?\nXin Mei said||you have a \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\".\nHuh?! {PA:20}Xin Mei?!{PA:20}||How do you know {PA:10}Xin Mei?!\nDon't worry about it.{PA:20}||I need that \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\".\n...{MS:0}{PA:20}{PA:20}||So, you met with Xin Mei.\nI see...{PA:20}||That means {PA:10}she's still in town.\nAbout the membership card...{MS:0}{PA:20}||I can't just hand it over to you.\nYou don't understand{PA:10}||how hard it was for me to get it...\nI'm sure it was very difficult to get,{PA:20}||but I need it... it's life or death.\nHmmm...{MS:0}{PA:20}||Okay.\nIf Xin Mei trusts you,{PA:10}||I can't refuse.\nYou have to understand that{PA:10}||I can't just give it to you...\nA \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\" is usually sold||for several million yen...\nHow about 500,000 yen?\n\nYou paid 500,000 yen.\nHere you go.{PA:20}\nYou received a \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\".\nIt's a memento||from the first time I met Xin Mei.\nPlease take good care of it.\nOkay.\nUhh... {PA:20}If you see Xin Mei again...{PA:20}||{MS:0}Ummm, {PA:10}never mind...\nDon't worry about it.{PA:20}||Good bye.\n\n\nWell...{PA:20}||Alright...\nYou look pretty desperate.\nOkay,{MS:1}{MS:0}{PA:20}||300,000 it is.\nYou paid 300,000 yen.\nYou received a \"{CC:ffc8c8}Shangri-la Membership Card{CR:00}\".\nIt's a memento||from the first time I met Xin Mei.\nPlease take good care of it.\nOkay.\nUhh... {PA:20}If you see Xin Mei again...{PA:20}||{MS:0}Ummm, {PA:10}never mind...\nDon't worry about it.{PA:20}||Good bye.\n\n...{MS:0}{PA:20}||Don't be ridiculous!\nI'm sorry,{PA:10}||but no.\n...{PA:20}||Are you threatening me?\nI refuse to deal with a person like you.{PA:20}||I'm sorry, {PA:10}but please leave.\nIt doesn't look like you can afford it.{MS:0}{PA:20}||I'm sorry, {PA:10}but I can't give it to you.\nCome back {PA:10}when you have||enough cash. {PA:20}See you later."
